 "intro_zh": "太白山是我国著名的秦岭山脉的主峰，以其高、寒、险、奇、秀富饶和神秘的特点闻名。主要景点有观音洞、三国古栈道、拜仙台、天圆地方、杨文洲纪念园、鬼谷子洞、洞天福地、铜墙铁壁、莲花峰瀑布、泼墨山、世外桃源、开天关、红桦坪、七女峰、石阵、下板寺、上板寺、文公庙、石海、拔仙台、四季滑雪场等。",
 "intro_en": "Mount Taibai (Chinese: 太白山; pinyin: Tàibái Shān) is a mountain located on the border between Mei, Taibai and Zhouzhi counties in the south west of Shaanxi Province, China on the watershed between the Han River and the Wei River. Its highest point, Baxiantai (Chinese: 拔仙台), rises to a height of 3,767 m (12,359 ft), the tallest in the Qinling Range as well as Shaanxi Province.",
 "intro_en_source": "wikipedia",
